<title>UK: FKI has 20.45 pct of Newman Tonks.</title>
<headline>FKI has 20.45 pct of Newman Tonks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>British engineer FKI Plc said on Monday it had received acceptances for 26,162,400 shares in British building equipment group Newman Tonks Plc, representing around 20.45 pct of the latter's issued ordinary share capital.</p>
<p>FKI launched a 195.7 million pound bid for Newman Tonks in December last year. Newman Tonks has urged its shareholders to reject the bid.</p>
<p>FKI said it had extended its offer to 1500 GMT on January 24, 1996 and urged Newman Tonks shareholders to accept.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
